---
title: Pollo Encacahuatado
tags: tocino, pollo, encacahuatado, mexican, comidamexicana
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dduxy2qM9l_/
date added: 2026-09-27
ai_image: true
---

Cut @tocino{7%slices} into strips and set aside. In a #pan{}, heat a bit of oil and add @onion{1} chopped. Sauté until translucent, then add @garlic{3%cloves} sliced, @dried chilies{4}, and @tomatoes{2} chopped. Cook for ~{5%minutes} until softened.

Add @peanuts{0.5%cups} and continue cooking another ~{2%minutes}. Transfer the mixture to a #blender{} and blend until smooth.

In the same #pan{}, cook the @chicken breast{500%g} pieces until browned. Season with @salt{} to taste. Add the reserved tocino strips and continue cooking until crispy.

Pour the blended sauce over the chicken and bacon, bringing the mixture to a simmer for ~{10%minutes} until the sauce thickens. Serve hot.
